  "content": "<h2><strong>新增更多鍛造模板升級（可製作或在新建築中發現）</strong></h2><h2><strong><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_59c0890a-06f3-48fb-be29-f2599786bdee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ff63147f-93e6-4626-add1-552c62900da8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_57347a90-782d-4a51-aa31-fc7bf1a121ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b64af97e-85cc-4ea0-92a8-edd406083969.png\" alt=\"\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_17a074bc-7d97-4306-8646-e230ef756a0d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></strong></h2><h2><strong>可將護甲從皮革逐步升級至鐵、金、鑽石</strong></h2><h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2b937ea5-7d09-4232-a20e-78d74cfcddbb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4e952191-c885-434e-b02b-f169203287ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eda71927-a372-4129-893e-8a9477f6f7ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></strong></h2><h2><strong>可將工具從木製逐步升級至石製、鐵製、金製、鑽石製</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1056718/description_f6032a44-7a38-440c-ba0c-a98e6d999277.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1056718/description_58d157a6-a5e3-49bf-afa8-a9ae13dcfc0b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1056718/description_cd042e8a-9f5f-438c-80fb-47e5d2e36cfa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1056718/description_8710c9bf-34c4-472a-ab5a-7b28f6ce5f25.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></p><h2><strong>可探索的建築結構：</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e3255380-3c5c-4a6c-8608-38daacad0be4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3b500ee3-245d-4149-a52d-2c3b7bf6e979.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_99b456d3-2eb4-4c6a-8850-e8b817780d8c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>",
